# The training data is 5.7 MB and recoverable: tg_model.fetch_data() pulls it
# back from Zenodo. tg_model.pkl is NOT ignored, even though it is a build
# artefact -- the deploy builds the image on the box from a fresh checkout, so
# anything not committed here simply does not exist in production, and without
# the pickle the designer silently falls back to the backbone handbook table.
tg_data.csv
measurements.db
campaigns.db
